2. Enable the Gemini API

For PocketSmart AI, use the Gemini Developer API. Google AI Studio lets you connect it to your Google Cloud project and create the API credentials.

Google AI Studio

Manage Gemini projects and API keys

Open Google AI Studio

Sign in using the same Google account.

Open the Dashboard and select Projects.

Click Import projects.

Find your PocketSmart AI Google Cloud project and import it.

Open the API Keys page.

Click Create API key and select your PocketSmart AI project.

New Gemini API keys created through AI Studio are authorization keys by default as of May 2026. Use the new key type rather than relying on an unrestricted legacy key. 
