3. Configure API access and billing

If you specifically want to enable the API in Google Cloud Console:

Generative Language API

Open API Library

Confirm that PocketSmart AI is selected in the project selector.

Open the Generative Language API page.

Click Enable if the option is available.

Return to AI Studio and verify that your API key is listed.

For paid API access, configure billing from the AI Studio billing page. The free tier has model-specific usage limits. Paid usage requires a linked billing account and may require a prepaid balance. Google states that the standard $300 Cloud welcome credit does not cover Gemini API usage for accounts opened after March 2, 2026. 
