4. Connect Gemini to PocketSmart AI

For a Python backend, install the official Google Gen AI SDK.

pip install -U google-genai

Create a .env file in your backend project:

GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY

Keep the API key private. Never commit it to GitHub or put it directly into frontend JavaScript. Use a backend server to make Gemini requests. 
