Create a test file named test_gemini.py:

from google import genai
import os

client = genai.Client(
    api_key=os.environ["GEMINI_API_KEY"]
)

response = client.models.generate_content(
    model="gemini-2.5-flash",
    contents="Hello! Explain PocketSmart AI in one sentence."
)

print(response.text)

Set the GEMINI_API_KEY environment variable before running the script. The model name shown is an example of a supported model to verify in AI Studio; Gemini 1.5 Flash and 1.5 Pro are older models and may no longer be available. 
